          "line": 72,
          "text": "for PES 2021. I am not entirely sure where that idea originated. One possibilty is a"
        },
        {
          "line": 110,
          "text": "<p class=\"gwarn\">The very first time (or after Steam downloads a new, updated PES2021.exe), there will be a small delay"
        },
