          "text": "4ccEditor is a save file (EDIT00000000) editor for Konami's Pro Evolution Soccer series.  At present, it supports save files from PES 2016-PES 2021.  This project contains the source code needed to compile 4ccEditor as a Microsoft Visual C++ project."
